    {
      "displayText": "Hello there! Have you ever wanted your Pokémon\nto heal themselves even while they attack<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nopponents in a Pokémon battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
