    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I’ve got good news for you—there are moves\nthat let you do just that! Some moves actually<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nabsorb HP from the opponent!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
